&control
  calculation = 'relax',
  prefix      = 'quartz_hex',
  outdir      = './tmp_quartz_hex',
  pseudo_dir  = './pseudos',
  tprnfor     = .true.,
  tstress     = .true.,
/
&system
  ibrav    = 0,
  nat      = 9,
  ntyp     = 2,
  ecutwfc  = 60,
  ecutrho  = 480,
  occupations = 'fixed',
  input_dft  = 'LDA',
/
&electrons
  conv_thr    = 1.0d-8,
  mixing_beta = 0.3,
/
&ions
  ion_dynamics = 'bfgs',
/
ATOMIC_SPECIES
  Si  28.0855  Si.pz-vbc.UPF
  O   15.9994  O.pz-van_ak.UPF

CELL_PARAMETERS (angstrom)
  4.916   0.0000   0.0000
 -2.458   4.2574   0.0000
  0.0000  0.0000   5.4050

ATOMIC_POSITIONS (angstrom)
  (copy his 9 atomic positions here)
K_POINTS automatic
  10 10 10  1 1 1   ! your converged mesh
